WEBVTT

00:31:58.984 --> 00:32:01.328
as my view of you guys does.

00:32:01.328 --> 00:32:04.048
CA: Thank you, Tim.

00:32:04.048 --> 00:32:09.780
(Applause)

00:32:09.780 --> 00:32:13.832
I mean, The New York Times
recently called for an amnesty for you.

00:32:13.832 --> 00:32:18.058
Would you welcome the chance
to come back to America?

00:32:18.058 --> 00:32:21.943
ES: Absolutely. There's really no question,

00:32:21.943 --> 00:32:24.525
the principles that have been the foundation

00:32:24.525 --> 00:32:26.918
of this project

00:32:26.918 --> 00:32:30.998
have been the public interest